OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent borough councillor    
OL,4,Adefects to Reform                      
OL,6,FAn independent councillor on Melton    
OL,7,FBorough Council has joined Reform UK.  
OL,9,FSteve Carter has defected from the     
OL,10,Fauthority's seven-strong Independent   
OL,11,FGroup to become Reform's first         
OL,12,Frepresentative on the Conservative-led 
OL,13,Fauthority.                             
OL,15,FCarter, who represents Asfordby, said  
OL,16,Fhe wanted to continue to work for      
OL,17,Fpeople in his ward with the backing of 
OL,18,FReform.                                
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
