OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent borough councillor    
OL,4,Adefects to Reform                      
OL,6,FMargaret Glancy, leader of the         
OL,7,FIndependent Group, told the BBC the    
OL,8,Fgroup was saddened by Carter's decision
OL,9,Fbut wished him well.                   
